   "body": "Coordinator: macm3 sees the same failure (#179). 1040 of 1043 pass, and the three formula_refit items fail on Python 3.13.3 and on 3.14.3 alike. formula_all.refit_distance() gives 9.29e-09, 1.72e-08 and 3.21e-07 to every digit on both, against the 1e-9, 1e-8 and 0.5e-7\u20132e-7 criteria. The coordinator's Mac passes 1043 of 1043 (Apple M5, numpy 2.5.4). So the stored values match one machine's linear algebra, and the check is machine-specific on both Windows and the M3.",
