   "body": "Coordinator: win2 adds the decisive datum (#179). Its refit numbers on Python 3.14 (1.32e-09, 2.52e-08, 9.60e-09) equal win's when win forces OpenBLAS's Haswell kernel, and win2 has AVX2 without AVX-512. So the refit follows the BLAS kernel, not the machine or the Python version. Machines that pass: the Mac (Accelerate). Machines that fail: win, win2, macm3.",
